Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.65,0:00:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You're as popular as ever, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.57,0:00:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.41,0:00:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't intend to stir up\Ntrouble in a place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.12,0:00:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should we believe you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.29,0:00:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if I felt like it\Nand wanted to resort to violence,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.55,0:00:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd manifest my Angel this very moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.64,0:00:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking students hostage\Nwould be as simple as that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.56,0:00:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact that I haven't done so\Nis proof I'm not lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.00,0:02:28.00,On Top,,0,0,0,,"February 9th"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.62,0:02:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not here to enjoy\Nschool life, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.54,0:02:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But believe me, I'd like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.84,0:02:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,If so, we'll throw you a welcome party.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.59,0:02:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,After your power is sealed, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.97,0:02:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, that's fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.43,0:02:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.43,0:02:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm okay with entrusting\Nmy Spirit power to you, however...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.40,0:03:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,There's just one condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.74,0:03:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And that would be...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.79,0:03:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's talk about it after school.\NThere're too many people around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.13,0:03:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You know why I summoned you:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.92,0:03:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Zodiac has fallen into Ratatoskr's hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.60,0:03:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Ratatoskr has ten spirits\Nunder its control.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.52,0:03:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ashamed of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.31,0:03:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not blaming anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.61,0:03:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, this situation is everything\NI could've hoped for.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.29,0:03:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Though Sister limits my information,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.92,0:03:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I can still use Beelzebub to hit\NRatatoskr where it hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.17,0:04:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about time we made it happen:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.72,0:04:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,To use Shido Itsuka as the key\Nto make the Spirits invert.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.97,0:04:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.68,0:04:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, I'll produce results.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.77,0:04:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.98,0:04:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, I've prepared\Na helper to lend a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.98,0:04:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Helper?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.57,0:04:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean, a Wizard?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.79,0:04:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me introduce you Nibeelcole,\Nthe daughters of my Demon King!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.76,0:04:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Start the operation at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.26,0:04:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I expect Shido Itsuka's head\Nby the end of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.10,0:04:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.48,0:05:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure, Shido?\NWouldn't it be safer if we came?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.23,0:05:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Tohka's right. It's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.11,0:05:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If you plan to face a Spirit who's cloaked\Nin shadow, you need us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.49,0:05:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreement. We'll come along.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.33,0:05:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, but I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.46,0:05:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true that Kurumi is dangerous,\Nbut she won't go back on her word.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.96,0:05:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, if I can't even talk\Nto Kurumi one-on-one,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.89,0:05:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got little to no hope of ever\Nsealing her Spirit power.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.15,0:05:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Kurumi. I came as promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.15,0:05:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.70,0:05:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,--Don't push!\N--Won't Shido see us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.82,0:05:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This morning, I noticed something:\NYou've changed a bit, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.21,0:05:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.33,0:06:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You look like you've matured.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.63,0:06:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Though, I suppose it's expected\Nwith all the carnage you've lived through.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.68,0:06:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Don't make fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.39,0:06:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, what's this condition of yours\Nfor sealing your Spirit power?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.85,0:06:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay. I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.56,0:06:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.99,0:06:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.83,0:06:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course. Good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.21,0:06:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed you stopped my attack!\NThat's Ellen for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.67,0:06:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Mana! Why are you here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.43,0:06:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this? Was our plan leaked?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.47,0:06:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,My, what a scary face!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.60,0:07:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep scowling like that\Nand you'll get wrinkles!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.02,0:07:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Artemisia, let's regroup!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.57,0:07:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Artemisia?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.40,0:07:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how you did it,\Nbut well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.53,0:07:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You managed to thwart our plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.58,0:07:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's annoying, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.21,0:07:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.46,0:07:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what now? Looks like\Nyou missed your big chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.68,0:07:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,For real? Our turn already?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.69,0:07:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever, as long as it helps Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.32,0:07:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you want us to kill her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.86,0:07:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Nibeelcole, it's all you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.78,0:07:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.28,0:07:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,--See you later!\N--Bye bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.41,0:08:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.46,0:08:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,--My, my!\N--My, my!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.13,0:08:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Nightmare!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.47,0:08:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Eww, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.51,0:08:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They all have the same face! Creepy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.31,0:08:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Like we're one to talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.35,0:08:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I can help if you're struggling, Mana.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.52,0:08:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate seeing the weak get picked on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.48,0:08:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch your mouth! I'll lop it off\Nalong with your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.32,0:08:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My, my! Should you really be\Nacting tough right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.91,0:08:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,After I'm done killing you, you're next!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.58,0:08:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido...? Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.01,0:08:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.43,0:09:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sorry. I spaced out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.85,0:09:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, allow me to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.69,0:09:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,My goal is the same as it was before:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.57,0:09:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You have Spirit power\Ncontained within your body...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.07,0:09:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,...and I wish to devour it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.28,0:09:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, there are ten Spirits worth\Nof power stored inside you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.04,0:09:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words,\Nyou want to kill me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.80,0:09:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Your goal is to seal my Spirit power,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.55,0:09:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,is it not?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.22,0:09:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.68,0:09:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to atone for all\Nyou've done and live a happy live.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.90,0:09:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my-- That's our ultimate goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.28,0:10:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too kind, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.74,0:10:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But, that's a problem. It's impossible\Nfor our desires to intersect.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.63,0:10:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, Shido...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.63,0:10:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather than both our dreams\Nstaying incomplete,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.38,0:10:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,isn't it better if one of them came true?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.60,0:10:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That is, even if one of us\Nloses everything for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.27,0:10:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.19,0:10:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't intend to steal\Nyour Spirit power by force.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.03,0:10:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm willing to do things your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.12,0:10:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.29,0:10:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How about whoever makes the other\Nfall for them is our winner?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.00,0:10:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.21,0:11:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,If I fall in love with you,\NI'll willingly give up my Spirit power.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.76,0:11:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.81,0:11:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,...if I make you fall in love\Nwith me first, I win.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.23,0:11:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, I get to devour you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.23,0:11:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You really think I'm gonna admit\NI'm in love knowing I'll die?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.82,0:11:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.57,0:11:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm confident I can make you say it,\Neven at the cost of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.41,0:11:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you not confident you can make me\Nhead over heels for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.63,0:11:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. You're on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.84,0:11:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make you choose me\Nover everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.56,0:11:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the Shido I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.65,0:11:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, shall we begin our date?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.25,0:12:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Who said you got to decide?!\NIf you lose, you die!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.17,0:12:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry... But I wasn't able\Nto reach Fraxinus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.97,0:12:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I know you had no choice but to\Naccept her challenge in that situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.23,0:12:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But knowing it and accepting it\Nare two different things!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.15,0:12:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid Big Brother!\NYou never think of yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.69,0:12:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.32,0:12:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you have a go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.83,0:12:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Letting comms go out at a time\Nlike that means I failed to support you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.71,0:13:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If you say so. You sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.34,0:13:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.18,0:13:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.68,0:13:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.43,0:13:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.64,0:13:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.40,0:13:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll let you off with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.07,0:13:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No fair, Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.07,0:13:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,--Shido! We're coming in!\N--Sorry we're late!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.87,0:13:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Addition. We had to change.\NAbout the strategy meeting...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.91,0:13:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy smokes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.58,0:13:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, uh... This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.50,0:13:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido! He...! He...!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.38,0:13:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,There, there. It's okay, Kotori.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.39,0:13:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido! What did you do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.10,0:13:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear me! Did we interrupt something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.02,0:13:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold up! It's not like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.73,0:14:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Doubt. It's not like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.65,0:14:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Kotori?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.03,0:14:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Aww! Kotori had all the fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.78,0:14:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you like little sisters?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.41,0:14:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I prepared\Nthese adoption forms, Big Bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.71,0:14:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This is getting out of hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.83,0:14:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that it's calmed down, let's move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.63,0:14:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido and Kurumi will be competing\Nto make the other fall for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.59,0:14:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Though she's after Shido's Spirit power,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.47,0:14:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,she may still appear before you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.10,0:14:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Be on your guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.85,0:14:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,R-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.40,0:14:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. I won't take a step outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.78,0:14:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to go that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.07,0:14:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm. It's puzzling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.91,0:14:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this Kurumi after\Nby stealing his Spirit power?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.04,0:15:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not after power itself, is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.63,0:15:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.75,0:15:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I have a good idea\Nabout what Kurumin's goal is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.30,0:15:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.26,0:15:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't trying to hide it, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.14,0:15:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, Kurumin has\Ncome to my place before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.64,0:15:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,She wanted me to\Nlook things up with Raziel:
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.98,0:15:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,About the Spirit of Origin\Nand how to beat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.61,0:15:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The Spirit of Origin...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.53,0:15:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. The Spirit that first\Nappeared 30 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.08,0:15:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,She wanted to know where and when\Nit showed up, and about its power.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.05,0:15:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to kill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.76,0:15:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.01,0:15:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So, her asking about\Nthe exact time and place...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.77,0:16:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Is to make the Spirit that appeared\N30 years ago never happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.77,0:16:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,When I got help from Kurumi Tokisaki\Nin the other world, she said as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.65,0:16:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. Kurumi can go into the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.16,0:16:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But to do so, she needs\Nthe power inside Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.54,0:16:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll kill the Spirit of Origin\Nthat appeared 30 years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.96,0:16:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,...and erase it from history.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.51,0:16:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Kurumi's goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.88,0:16:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Argh, jeez! Now there're\Neven more questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.80,0:16:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill the Spirit of Origin?\NWhy would she do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.31,0:16:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous to dig deeper\Nknowing so little.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.48,0:16:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's worthwhile trying to connect\Nthe dots, no matter how small.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.82,0:16:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.82,0:16:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But the problem is that\NKurumi's shrouded in mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.49,0:17:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got something I wanna say, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.00,0:17:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mana! What happened to you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.46,0:17:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no big deal. Just some scratches.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.05,0:17:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you to sit\Nyour butt in a medical pod?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.09,0:17:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave her permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.97,0:17:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,She said she had something\Nimportant to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.02,0:17:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.74,0:17:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurumi's clone army?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.66,0:17:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I think this fight is what caused\Nthe communications disruption.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.58,0:17:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I managed to thwart DEM.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.29,0:17:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you said in the report.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.92,0:18:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What I don't get is how you\Npredicted Ellen would attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.01,0:18:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.60,0:18:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Nightmare... Kurumi Tokisaki told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.32,0:18:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,She said that Ellen would be launching\Nan attack on Big Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.20,0:18:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,She told me exactly where and when...\Nwhich was yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.62,0:18:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So? Why did the lovely Mana\Nkeep this secret from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.54,0:18:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just, I figured you wouldn't let me\Ngo if I said anything, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.68,0:18:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You know me well. You and I\Nwill have a long talk later.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.26,0:18:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh! Please spare me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.56,0:18:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Back to Kurumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.69,0:18:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Why did she tell Mana\Nthat Ellen would attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.61,0:18:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,For starters, how did she\Nknow it would happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.53,0:19:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps she just wanted to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.57,0:19:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Tokisaki Kurumi is after\Nyour Spirit power.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.45,0:19:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,She wouldn't be pleased\Nif DEM got you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.67,0:19:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And she has an army of clones\Nto gather information.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.21,0:19:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe she found out\Nabout their plans somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.34,0:19:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's true...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.43,0:19:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Something on your mind, Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.48,0:19:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.77,0:19:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing. Anyway,\Nlet's prepare for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.61,0:19:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha--?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.87,0:19:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Shido. What a lovely day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.37,0:19:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurumi?! Why are you here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.50,0:19:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,My, my. Is it odd for classmates\Nto walk to school together?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.17,0:20:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.84,0:20:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Reine, we've got trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.35,0:20:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood. Kurumi, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.97,0:20:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,She's gone on the offensive.\NI'll contact Kotori.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.85,0:20:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Just play along for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.23,0:20:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah! Kurumi, will you come with me?\NI wanna show you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.40,0:20:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? I can't wait to see what it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.49,0:20:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, after you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.29,0:20:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.63,0:20:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Where all the local cats gather.\NI thought you might like it, Kurumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.80,0:20:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I don't know why you'd think that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.27,0:20:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon. You, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.31,0:20:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Well, if you insist...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.86,0:21:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.70,0:21:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's so funny, Shido?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.00,0:21:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry. That wasn't supposed to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.96,0:21:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, there's lots of other cats.\NTry petting one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.22,0:21:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No, thanks. It'll just run away again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.18,0:21:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll go better this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.18,0:21:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.64,0:21:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.31,0:21:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There, there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.27,0:21:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right! This little kitten likes it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.95,0:21:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.87,0:21:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall we say round one ended in a tie?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.49,0:21:55.00,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Episode 09:\N'Nightmare's Seduction.'"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.66,0:21:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Meow...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.71,0:23:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Valentine's is here!\NExcited girls! Panicking boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.18,0:23:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,When the world's fate is involved,\Nexcitement and panic is expected!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.93,0:23:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time: "Girl Time."\NWatch it or I'll seal you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.85,0:23:39.98,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Episode 10: 'Girl Time.'"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.98,0:23:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.98,0:23:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,
